dia/battle-of-the-golden-spurs">Battle of the Golden Spurs</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1340</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/edward-iii-of-england">Edward III</a> is proclaimed king of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/france">France</a> at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ghent">Ghent</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1384</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/flanders">Flanders</a> passes to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/philip-the-bold">Philip the Bold of Burgundy</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1432</span><span class="rf-text">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ghent-altarpiece">Ghent Altarpiece</a> is completed</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1795</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/france">France</a> annexes the county</span></li></ol>
